[Header]
missionType = "Tutorial"

missionNumber = 8
title="Day Four"


myStartMoney = 10000
myTech = ""


[Options]


[A.]
<h2>~yAwake From Nap</h2><P>
There are only five trials and you have passed three.  The last two are soon to come.<br>
~[Iresidence.6]
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=See Progress,tell,Stats
$Button=Rest,tell,Rest


[REST]
<h2>~yThat Evening</h2><P>
The night falls, and you go to bed.
As you fall into a deep sleep, you hear a voice.<p>
<i>{TpVguide}</i> <?{Tp_name}>{Tp_yourname}, </?>The time has come for you to be tested.
<P>
Selected a tech for your Fourth trial.
$Checked=Sun,tell,Sun,0,{TpVc11}
$Checked=Wind,tell,Wind,0,{TpVc21}
$Checked=Rain,tell,Rain,0,{TpVc31}
$Checked=Thunder,tell,thunder,0,{TpVc41}
$Checked=All,tell,All,0,{TpVc51}
$OnExit= ,MissionBegin,TpVmoney


[SUN]
<$config,TpVc1=1>
<$config,TpVc2=0>
<$config,TpVc3=0>
<$config,TpVc4=0>
<$config,TpVc5=0>
<$config,TpVmyTech1={TpVtechSun;}>
<$config,TpVmyTech2={TpVtechSun2;}>

[WIND]
<$config,TpVc1=0>
<$config,TpVc2=1>
<$config,TpVc3=0>
<$config,TpVc4=0>
<$config,TpVc5=0>

<$config,TpVmyTech1={TpVtechWind;}>
<$config,TpVmyTech2={TpVtechWind2;}>


[RAIN]
<$config,TpVc1=0>
<$config,TpVc2=0>
<$config,TpVc3=1>
<$config,TpVc4=0>
<$config,TpVc5=0>

<$config,TpVmyTech1={TpVtechRain;}>
<$config,TpVmyTech2={TpVtechRain2;}>

[THUNDER]
<$config,TpVc1=0>
<$config,TpVc2=0>
<$config,TpVc3=0>
<$config,TpVc4=1>
<$config,TpVc5=0>

<$config,TpVmyTech1={TpVtechThunder;}>
<$config,TpVmyTech2={TpVtechThunder2;}>


[ALL]
<$config,TpVc1=0>
<$config,TpVc2=0>
<$config,TpVc3=0>
<$config,TpVc4=0>
<$config,TpVc5=1>

<$config,TpVmyTech1={TpVtechAll;}>
<$config,TpVmyTech2={TpVtechAll2;}>

[Stats]
<H2>~yStats:</H2><P>
Number of Attempts at Trial 3: ~i{TpV3}~. <P>
<H2>~yNotes:</H2><P>
Each ~i1~. represents one unit of measurement. <br>
For example, ~i1 1~. equals two.
$Button=Return to Quest,tell,A.

[END]
